"Build US-0405 as specified in docs/features/epic-04-branding-and-desktop.md: a settings view inside the app (in the content frame, LCARS style, works in full screen) reached from Inställningar in the left arm, the app menu (Cmd/Ctrl+,) and the menu item; sections Verktyg (aidlc, claude and shell paths with auto-detection, versions, native file dialogs, validation before save, used everywhere the app starts them), Utseende (Animationer, Helskärm vid start, Språk once EPIC-07 exists), Projekt (default folder, recent projects with removal, links to Projektinställningar) and Om (app version, AI-DLC version, Auctum symbol, repo and feature-doc links); settings saved in the app settings.json through sanitize(), nothing written into any project, absolute paths never passed through a shell; existing small dialogs move into the view so each setting has one home; labelled fields, named file buttons and focus moved into the view for keyboard and screen readers. Release plan: docs/releases/0.2.3.md."
